## Installation instructions

### Steam Workshop

1. Click **Subscribe** on this Steam Workshop page so Steam downloads the mod into `<Steam>/steamapps/workshop/content/233860/` (containing `{{ assembly_name }}.mod`, `meitou.json`, and `{{ assembly_name }}.dll`).
2. Open **Meitou Launcher**, enable `{{ assembly_name }}.mod` in your load order, and launch **Meitou Client**.
{%- if repo_url | trim %}

### Manual installation (GitHub Releases)

1. Download the latest `{{ assembly_name }}-<version>.zip` archive from [GitHub Releases]({{ (repo_url | trim).rstrip('/') }}/releases/latest).
2. Extract `{{ assembly_name }}-<version>.zip` into your Kenshi `mods/` directory so the final path is `<Kenshi>/mods/{{ assembly_name }}/{{ assembly_name }}.mod` (alongside `meitou.json` and `{{ assembly_name }}.dll`).
3. Enable `{{ assembly_name }}.mod` in **Meitou Launcher** (or add `{{ assembly_name }}.mod` to `<Kenshi>/data/mods.cfg`) and launch **Meitou Client**.
{%- endif %}

### Uninstalling

Disable `{{ assembly_name }}.mod` in **Meitou Launcher** and click **Unsubscribe** on this Steam Workshop page (or remove the `{{ assembly_name }}/` folder from `<Kenshi>/mods/` if installed manually).

