## Issues/Incompatibility

Please report bugs, incompatibilities, or other issues on the [GitHub Issues]({{ (repo_url | trim).rstrip('/') }}/issues) page. Issues posted on Nexus Mods or Steam Workshop may be overlooked.

## Security & build verification

Meitou code mods run compiled C# inside the game process; third-party code mods are inherently potentially unsafe. Every Steam Workshop upload is extracted directly from the exact same GitHub Release ZIP built by GitHub Actions from the tagged source commit, verified byte-for-byte against its published `.contents.sha256` manifest, with MSBuild binary logs, embedded portable PDBs/sources, and GitHub build-provenance attestations for both the ZIP and extracted DLL — see [Build Transparency & Verification]({{ (repo_url | trim).rstrip('/') }}#build-transparency--verification) and the release changelog links for verification commands and limitations.
{%- endif %}

